# Wilsonline.

**Authors:** Loeding, Deborah

## Abstract
Describes H. W. Wilson's information retrieval system which provides access to such familiar printed indexes as &quot;Social Sciences Index,&quot;&quot;Humanities Index,&quot;&quot;Education Index,&quot; and &quot;Reader's Guide to Periodical Literature.&quot; Use of this flexible system is explained and illustrated. (CDD)

